Code and data to develop the spawning seasonality and the maturity and transition ogives. The codes are titled and do as follows:

Scamp maturity = development of maturity ogives
Scamp monthly and annual sample sizes = generates plots of annual and monthly sample sizes
Scamp repro w age data = generates visualizations of reproductively staged indiivduals with accompannying age data
Scamp staging analysis = generates visualizations of scamp reproductive stage by month
Scamp staging.xlsx = data file needed to run all scripts
Scamp transition = development of transition ogives
